From bb7b82fc6ac6d4b769bb3e464c85f4999453913d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Hargett <plaztiksyke@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:08:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Keep rotated and skewed filter layers aligned with user
 space, and round filter regions out as Skia does

---
