 .../feGaussianBlur/complex-transform.png      | Bin 3178 -> 3161 bytes
 .../filters/feImage/with-subregion-5.png      | Bin 5834 -> 3032 bytes
 .../filters/feOffset/complex-transform.png    | Bin 1523 -> 1544 bytes
 .../fePointLight/complex-transform.png        | Bin 8737 -> 8867 bytes
 .../filters/feSpotLight/complex-transform.png | Bin 5452 -> 5464 bytes
 .../filters/feTile/complex-transform.png      | Bin 2021 -> 2405 bytes
 .../tests/filters/filter/on-a-thin-rect.png   | Bin 399 -> 427 bytes
 .../tests/tests/filters/filter/path-bbox.png  | Bin 1195 -> 1196 bytes
 .../transform-on-shape-with-filter-region.png | Bin 10218 -> 10032 bytes
